\fs24 \cf0 Ayr\uc0\u305  ve lokal \'e7al\u305 \u351 an bir \'93AI Development Prompt Compiler\'94 geli\u351 tirelim.
\f1\b0 \
\'c7al\uc0\u305 \u351 ma ad\u305 : 
\f0\b PromptForge Local
\f1\b0 \
Bu \'fcr\'fcn\'fcn g\'f6revi promptu daha uzun veya daha profesyonel g\'f6stermek olmayacak. Ham talebini:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Se\'e7ili projenin mevcut durumuna g\'f6re anlayacak\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Eksik veya \'e7eli\uc0\u351 kili noktalar\u305  tespit edecek\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Gereksiz ba\uc0\u287 lam\u305  ay\u305 klayacak\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Uygulanabilir g\'f6rev tan\uc0\u305 m\u305 na \'e7evirecek\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ayn\uc0\u305  g\'f6revi Qwen Code, Codex veya Claude Code i\'e7in ayr\u305  bi\'e7imde haz\u305 rlayacak\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sonu\'e7lar\uc0\u305  \'f6l\'e7erek hangi prompt yap\u305 s\u305 n\u305 n daha ba\u351 ar\u305 l\u305  oldu\u287 unu \'f6\u287 renecek\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Ana geli\uc0\u351 tirme arac\u305  
\f0\b Qwen Code
\f1\b0  olacak. Codex ve Claude, Qwen kotas\uc0\u305  bitti\u287 inde veya belirli i\u351 lerde ikinci se\'e7enek olarak kullan\u305 lacak. PromptForge\'92un kendi AI motoru ise elinizdeki DeepSeek Flash API olacak.\
Bir teknik not: Model ad\uc0\u305  kodda sabitlenmemeli. DeepSeek\'92in g\'fcncel resm\'ee model listesinde 
\f2\fs26 deepseek-v4-flash
\f1\fs24  bulunuyor. Sizdeki servis bunu \'93DeepSeek V2 Flash\'94 \uc0\u351 eklinde adland\u305 r\u305 yorsa 
